# Week 4 – Image Chunking

## Objective
To divide large webpage screenshots into smaller image sections for efficient visual analysis.

## Implementation
- Used the ImageChunker module from ai/optimizer.py.
- Divided large screenshots into smaller overlapping chunks.
- Maintained a 60-pixel overlap between sections.
- Detected blank image sections.
- Skipped unnecessary blank sections during analysis.

## Benefits
- Reduces unnecessary image processing.
- Helps detect UI defects in different webpage sections.
- Prevents important UI elements from being missed at section boundaries.

## Testing
Tested image chunking using a tall webpage screenshot of 1200 x 2400 pixels.

## Result
Successfully demonstrated screenshot division and blank-section detection.
